{
  "schema": "web-ui-page/1",
  "title": "nvd_nist_known_vulns 利用ガイド",
  "theme": "auto",
  "description": "CPE 2.3 名から NVD CVE API 2.0 の既知の脆弱性を取得し、JSON Lines で出す単一ファイル。",
  "icon": "./icon.png",
  "favicon": "./favicon.png",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "badges",
      "items": [
        "📄 単一ファイル",
        "🧰 標準ライブラリのみ",
        "🐍 Python 3.11+"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "📥 取得",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1 ファイルを置くだけで動きます（pip 不要）。"
        },
        {
          "type": "output",
          "text": "curl -fsSLO https://raw.githubusercontent.com/myon-bioinformatics/nvd_nist_known_vulns/main/nvd_nist_known_vulns.py"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "▶️ 実行",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "card",
          "title": "🔎 CPE を指定して取得",
          "text": "--cpe は繰り返せます。結果は標準出力に JSONL（nvd-cve-summary/1）。",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "output",
              "text": "$ python nvd_nist_known_vulns.py --cpe \"cpe:2.3:a:openssl:openssl:1.1.1c:*:*:*:*:*:*:*\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "card",
          "title": "📝 config.ini から",
          "text": "--cpe を省くと config.ini の [cpeName] を読みます。",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "output",
              "text": "$ python nvd_nist_known_vulns.py --silent --output result.jsonl"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "card",
          "title": "🚨 重大度で絞る",
          "text": "CVSS v3 の重大度（LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH / CRITICAL）で絞ります。",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "output",
              "text": "$ python nvd_nist_known_vulns.py --cvss-v3-severity CRITICAL"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "card",
          "title": "⏱️ 知っておくこと",
          "text": "API キーなしは 6 秒間隔、NVD_API_KEY があれば 0.6 秒間隔。終了コードは 0 成功 / 1 NVD・出力の失敗 / 2 使い方・入力の誤り。結果が自分の環境に当てはまるかは別途の確認が必要です。",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "🐍 Python から呼ぶ",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "output",
          "text": "$ python -c 'import nvd_nist_known_vulns as n; print(n.calculate_cvss_base(\"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H\"))'\n{'version': '3.1', 'base_score': 9.8, 'base_severity': 'CRITICAL'}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "🔗 リンク",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "links",
          "items": [
            {
              "label": "📦 リポジトリ",
              "href": "https://github.com/myon-bioinformatics/nvd_nist_known_vulns"
            },
            {
              "label": "📖 README",
              "href": "https://github.com/myon-bioinformatics/nvd_nist_known_vulns#readme"
            },
            {
              "label": "📄 nvd_nist_known_vulns.py",
              "href": "https://github.com/myon-bioinformatics/nvd_nist_known_vulns/blob/main/nvd_nist_known_vulns.py"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
